OL,3,ATrain worker recalls repelling attacker
OL,4,Awith frying pan
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliams, 33, of Langford Road in
OL,7,FPeterborough, denies 10 counts of
OL,8,Fattempted murder, and four other
OL,9,Falleged attempted murders in earlier
OL,10,Fincidents in Peterborough and London.
